Hi all,

I'm excited to announce that we will have a booth at SUSECON 2-4 2019!

https://www.susecon.com

Thank you to SUSE for providing the Ceph Foundation space to allow
developers and users of Ceph to showcase demos, and an area to meet
for questions and discussions.

If you can join the conference this year, please consider providing
content and/or support for questions at the booth. Please reply to me
directly if you're interested.

Thanks!

